OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours 'broken' over family's
OL,4,Ahouse fire deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeighbours of a mother and three
OL,7,Fchildren killed in a house fire have
OL,8,Fsaid their community has been "broken"
OL,9,Fby their deaths.
OL,11,FThe fire at the house on Stone Square
OL,12,Fin Bootle, Merseyside, "spread rapidly"
OL,13,Fin the early hours of Tuesday morning.
OL,14,FAn injured man who was outside the
OL,15,Fhouse when fire crews arrived remains
OL,16,Fin hospital.
OL,18,FCards addressed to the family, as well
OL,19,Fas teddy bears and photographs, have
OL,20,Fbeen left close to the scene by
OL,21,Fbereaved relatives and shocked locals.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
