OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours 'broken' over family's
OL,4,Ahouse fire deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FLoti Nambobe, who is taking care of the
OL,7,Ffamily's dog after the fire, said:
OL,8,F"It's a community. It's broken. It
OL,9,Fhurts."
